      <ul class="rows">
        <li class="rv">
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Structural steel fabrication</h3>
            <p>Cutting, setting out and welding of structural steel members and sections.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="rv">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Welding</h3>
            <p>Bead runs, tacks and stitch welds on steel sections and plate.</p>
