  <section class="method" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker rv">Method</p>
      <h2 id="method-h" class="rv">How the joint is worked</h2>
      <div class="phases">
        <div class="phase rv">
          <h3>Square and mark</h3>
          <p>Plate and section are squared, marked and set to the joint line before any arc is struck.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="phase rv">
          <h3>Tack and align</h3>
          <p>Tacks hold the joint true and square while the run is laid along the seam.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="phase rv">
          <h3>Run and dress</h3>
          <p>The bead is run along the joint, then dressed and cleaned back to the plate.</p>
        </div>
